<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Indeed! Do you know what your absence is doing to this office? We had to cancel Grope O'Clock. The men are just wandering the halls, hands outstretched, bumping into furniture. Davidson actually grabbed a potted plant yesterday. Said it was wearing your perfume. It wasn't. That's just desperation you're smelling."\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah dry-heaved quietly. "Gerald, I'm ill."\
