<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>"Yes, but he's holding the screenshots, which makes them his. Possession is nine-tenths of the credit. The other tenth is having a penis. Basic mathematics." Gerald's voice took on what he probably thought was a stern, fatherly tone but came across more like a sea lion attempting Shakespeare. "This is what happens when you abandon your post, Sarah. Other people have to pick up your slack. And by slack, I mean the work you've already done that they can claim as theirs."\
