<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah hung up before Gerald could continue, mostly because the alternative involved screaming until her throat bled, and that would upset the Elvi guards.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>She placed the tablet face-down on the bed with the deliberate care of someone who'd rather be placing explosives. Through the window, she could see the Elvi Parliament building in the distance, where they were probably discussing something ridiculous like the proper ratio of sequins to rhinestones on combat jumpsuits.\
